    rdfs:label "Чичибабін" ;
    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "The story of the outstanding poet Boris Chichibabin, whose whole life is connected with Ukraine. The film features three-dimensional photo and video footage, memories of the poet's widow, friends, and members of the legendary literary studio, which was headed by Chichibabin. Installation of the tape is made in the original form: as if the poet confirms or complements the memories of his contemporaries." ;
