    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "The film tells the story of a married couple of civilians who came under intense fire from the enemy Russian army in the Izyum region in their car. The 93rd \"Kholodny Yar\" military brigade, not having the opportunity to safely approach Ukrainian civilians, conducted an unprecedented rescue operation with the help of drones. The plot is based on real events." ;
    ex:Duration 32 ;
    ex:Genre <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Genre/%D0%92%D1%96%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B9>,
