    ex:Description "The young, curious journalist Sofia meets the investigator Bohdan Mazepa under tragic circumstances. Soon their paths intersect: Sofia receives the task to write an article about our valorous militia, where that very successful captain having no unsolved cases is to appear as the protagonist. Except for one.  What secrets does this case hide and how will the fates of Bohdan and Sofia develop, will love be able to survive the frightful truth?" ;
