<http://ukrainian-movies.org/movie/Q137599733> a ex:Movie ;
    rdfs:label "Тихий терор" ;
    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "Russian propaganda is doing everything to create a picture of \"peaceful life\" in Kherson, but in reality it kidnaps and tortures people, leaves them in information isolation and does not allow them to move to other regions. What does the occupation regime really look like and who are its victims?" ;
