<http://ukrainian-movies.org/movie/Q139573926> a ex:Movie ;
    rdfs:label "Šëlkovaja pautina" ;
    ex:Description "We know little about those who made Šëlkovaja Pautina. There are no records of the cameraman’s name – which is a pity since today the most attractive aspect of this film are views of old St. Petersburg. The capital of Russia was by no means the capital of Russian filmmaking: until the mid-1920s Moscow was miles ahead both in experimental and commercial cinema. With only a dozen surviving films from St. Petersburg this one is an important rediscovery." ;
    ex:Duration 27 ;
