    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "A film about Ihor Kirilchatenko, a volunteer, veteran of the Russian-Ukrainian war, actor, and director from Dnipro, known by his pseudonym Artist. After being wounded and suffering from depression, the man found the strength to return to life through creativity and founded the independent patriotic theatre Art Front - a space for healing, recovery and the search for meaning for veterans." ;
