        <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/United%20States%20of%20America> ;
    ex:Description "Five Ukrainian children out of the many who have experienced absolute horror during the Russian war of aggression, lost parents, experienced destruction and the need to flee. The documentary allows them to have their say whilst documenting their trauma and displacement, as well as the courage and creativity with which they defy the war." ;
