    ex:Description "A successful young actor stands on the threshold of world fame. All that's left is one audition, with a Hollywood director known for his eccentricities. Which talents should he show, and which should he keep hidden? How do you put your best foot forward when you're not alone in your body, when there are, in fact, at least seven more of you? A singular chain of events in the life of a man with eight personalities. With a happy ending! Or not quite so happy. Or not for all eight." ;
