    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "A girl Ania dreams of a young man, a sailor, whom she saw only once in a photograph. At this time, a sailor, who turns out to be illegally transporting weapons, dreams of meeting an unusual girl, leaving a dangerous business and leaving for the islands. Ania reads \"Mahabharata\", \"Iliad\", \"Elder Edda\" and listens to rock and roll every day by the sea. The sailor and the girl are destined to meet in the final, and a faithful friend will help to avoid danger - an old car, \"Volga\" GAZ-21." ;
    ex:Duration 75 ;
    ex:Genre <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Genre/%D0%94%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0>,
