    ex:Description "A romantic story with elements of humor and dramatic moments that occurs within a few days on a yacht in the middle of the Black Sea. Fatal meeting of two opposites - rough hunter, who does not give their victims no chance, and defenseless victim who wants to find love at least one night. Fate gave two different people to share piece of life, giving them the chance to see a better world. Where not need to be a hunter or a victim, where you can be a partner and support each other. I understand that today's hunter may tomorrow become a victim himself." ;
    ex:Duration 90 ;
