<http://ukrainian-movies.org/movie/Q16708219> a ex:Movie ;
    rdfs:label "Между нами" ;
    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Russia>,
        <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "We remember dates and facts, while losing tiny details – like a bouquet of summer wildflowers, tears from onions, winter cold on a bus stop bench. We remember the birthdays of our beloved and how they like their tea, but we forget unexpected touches, floating glances, casual chats. And sometimes – when we are rapidly torn apart from each other – we engrave such moments into our memory." ;
