    ex:Description "\"The First Death\" is the second film in the series of documentaries \"Winter that changed us\". This is a story about those who died for freedom and for their own state. This time, the focus is on the story of Serhiy Nigoyan, a guy who was killed in the center of the Ukrainian capital in late January." ;
