    ex:Description "Odesa businessman Marfela blackmails a visiting young man, Nikita, into taking on a job that he considers pure pleasure: he must compromise his wife so that Marfela can divorce her and inherit his dying brother's billions without any losses. Nikita seduces the woman, but she makes him a counteroffer: Elena asks him to kill her tyrannical husband. Marfela also demands that his treacherous wife be eliminated. The couple showers Nikita with threats, unaware that he is not who he claims to be..." ;
