<http://ukrainian-movies.org/movie/Q16715322> a ex:Movie ;
    rdfs:label "Самооборона" ;
    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "The fifth film in the series of documentaries \"Winter that changed us\". What is self-defense, directors Konstantin Klyatskin and Maria Ponomareva undertook to explain. Participants of the protests will remember how the Maidan self-defense arose. One of the heroes of the film is Thomas from the group \"Mandri\", who, being an active participant in Euromaidan, participated in the delight of the Ministry of Culture. The fact that people had to physically defend themselves, defending themselves from their own power, director Konstantin Klyatskin calls a phenomenon that is difficult to fit in the head..." ;
