    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "To support her husband, son and mother, the heroine moves abroad to work odd jobs. Whenever she returns home, she promises herself not leave anymore. But every time she doesn’t keep her word. Because every family member already has a certain habit: her mother likes to watch TV, her son wants to have stylish clothes and a phone, her husband likes to drink with friends in a garage. None of them is working. She hesitates when gets called about a new job. But watching her family makes the heroine realize: she has no other choice, except for going abroad again." ;
    ex:Duration 10 ;
    ex:Genre <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Genre/%D0%94%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0> ;
