<http://ukrainian-movies.org/movie/Q28704022> a ex:Movie ;
    rdfs:label "Холодний Яр. Інтро" ;
    ex:Country <http://ukrainian-movies.org/Country/Ukraine> ;
    ex:Description "Kholodny Yar is a misterious place in the heart of Ukraine, where history meets present in strange ways. Stunning landscapes and meditative moods are represented in this version of the film. Following the nature we plunge in the history of the paradoxical amount of rebellions and try to answer the question: what forces people to defend their freedom at the cost of their own lives?" ;
